title: LobbyPlant
---
<<declare $lobby_plant_interaction_times = 0>>
<<if $lobby_plant_interaction_times==1>>
 It's another plant!
 Yours is highly superior.
 <<set $lobby_plant_interaction_times += 1>>
<<elseif $lobby_plant_interaction_times==2>>
 The plant now looks insulted.
 Would you like to apologize?
 -> Yes
  It seems to be satisfied.
  You're filled with the power of apologizing to plants.
 -> No
  It seems to be growing murderous intent.
  You're filled with the power of being rivals with a plant.
 <<set $lobby_plant_interaction_times += 1>>
<<else>>
 It's another plant!
<<endif>>
===
